%% aoneahsan-cccs-brainstorming — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Idea / build request arrives]) --> specified{Already fully specified,<br/>no open questions?}
    specified -->|yes| plan[Skip to aoneahsan-cccs-task-planning]
    specified -->|no| context[Explore project context:<br/>files, docs, recent commits]

    context --> scope{Spans several independent<br/>subsystems?}
    scope -->|yes| decompose[Decompose into sub-projects;<br/>brainstorm the first one]
    scope -->|no| ask
    decompose --> ask

    ask[Ask ONE question at a time<br/>AskUserQuestion, multiple-choice where it fits]
    ask --> blocking{Owner-only decision?}
    blocking -->|yes| pause[aoneahsan-cccs-ask-the-owner:<br/>ask + PAUSE + hold]
    pause --> ask
    blocking -->|no| enough{Understand purpose,<br/>constraints, success criteria?}
    enough -->|no| ask
    enough -->|yes| approaches[Offer 2-3 approaches<br/>+ recommendation]

    approaches --> design[Present design in sections,<br/>each scaled to complexity;<br/>apply YAGNI]
    design --> approve{Owner approves<br/>this section?}
    approve -->|no, revise| design
    approve -->|yes, all sections| gate([Design approved →<br/>aoneahsan-cccs-task-planning])

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class specified,scope,blocking,enough,approve gate
    class trigger,gate,plan terminal
